d a lot of what I saw. I'm glad you like Amano's (oni girl's) design, even if she doesn't have large breasts XD\n\nShe got a redesign over the year, but all the things you liked about her are still there if you're willing to draw her! I don't have any real request in terms of composition or posing, so just have fun with it!\n\nAlso, her pigtails just have to look like horns, you don't have to strictly follow the reference sheet for that so long as a horn-like silhouette is there.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/026ancr7svj4", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tam536000/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/41f38b92/uploads/origins/05739e61-be14-47b7-aff3-b502f6a2c6a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c20e104bfe26b499110fed00139bcee", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/41f38b92/uploads/origins/05739e61-be14-47b7-aff3-b502f6a2c6a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c20e104bfe26b499110fed00139bcee, https://si.imgix.net/41f38b92/uploads/origins/05739e61-be14-47b7-aff3-b502f6a2c6a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9bb1ad19e77308410fabca3d35661b7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/41f38b92/uploads/origins/05739e61-be14-47b7-aff3-b502f6a2c6a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c9d5167c4a3a269dc604dbf2b5077cc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Omakase <3\n\nCan find some references here: https://bsky.app/profile/cliodynamics.bsky.social", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tam536000/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/236cd954/uploads/origins/ecb9767e-8d8d-4f4f-9e56-168b0e61764e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb32f77f8260047f57ccff19596cd082", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/236cd954/uploads/origins/ecb9767e-8d8d-4f4f-9e56-168b0e61764e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=20